    "detailed_description": "<h1>DON'T FORGET TO WHISTLIST!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1754928904\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1754928904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1754928904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're late for a meeting, and the entire city seems designed to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good Luck</strong> is a third-person,  physics-based co-op rage platformer where you walk through a city filled with unexpected traps, absurd dangers, and no second chances. One mistake? You're back at the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op mode  \u2014 better with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge that tests your patience with\u00a0zero checkpoints. No mercy!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprising obstacles like exploding trash bins, falling streetlights, slippery banana peels, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized  visuals and slapstick physics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just get to your meeting.  <br>That\u2019s it, just walk.<br>Sounds easy, right?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Mode (2-5 Players)</strong>:<strong>\u00a0Suffering with friends is just better</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/b26eb1920745be45da9b28a101be8383.poster.avif?t=1754928904\" width=560 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/b26eb1920745be45da9b28a101be8383.webm?t=1754928904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/b26eb1920745be45da9b28a101be8383.mp4?t=1754928904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One small mistake? Back to the start. No Mercy!</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/40d747c62eb454d0cde6fa375067f7c0.poster.avif?t=1754928904\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/40d747c62eb454d0cde6fa375067f7c0.webm?t=1754928904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/40d747c62eb454d0cde6fa375067f7c0.mp4?t=1754928904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn by failing\u2014again and again!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/c59804baf43cf04aa59d56ce060c070b.poster.avif?t=1754928904\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/c59804baf43cf04aa59d56ce060c070b.webm?t=1754928904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/c59804baf43cf04aa59d56ce060c070b.mp4?t=1754928904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There's One Simple Goal: Survive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/e3ff245babec8d338c6f33ec08d8da41.poster.avif?t=1754928904\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/e3ff245babec8d338c6f33ec08d8da41.webm?t=1754928904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/e3ff245babec8d338c6f33ec08d8da41.mp4?t=1754928904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you patient enough?  <br>Are you stubborn enough?  <br>Let\u2019s find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good Luck.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/4b68d103f6275b1ae7cd1de1d2dd8df4.avif?t=1754928904\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epilepsy warning: contains some surprising elements.</strong></p>",
